      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've made this in udon already, you need to create a script that, at start event, will create an array of players. using the player array function 'ctor' is the magic sauce to get it to work. In the int, add max numbers of players for the world. Then on player joined events, add them to the array and on player joined, take them off the array. The script is local and will always add the local player first, then everyone else. You can use the player ID to index people appropriately.",
